<p>Every load of this page calls a Netlify Function, which bumps a real counter in Netlify Blobs and hands back the new total. Refresh, or open this page in a new tab, and the number moves:</p>
<p class="view-counter" data-view-counter data-view-counter-key="view-counter-demo">
  {% icon "eye", "view-counter__icon" %}
  <span class="view-counter__count" data-view-counter-count>—</span>
  <span class="view-counter__label">views of this page</span>
</p>
